{
  "script_id": "spherical-lune",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.28,
      "size": 52416,
      "text": "平面上最少几条边能围出一个图形？三条。两条直线最多交于一点，根本围不起来。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.21,
      "size": 51408,
      "text": "球面上不一样。任意两个大圆必定交于对径的两个点，它们之间就夹出一个月牙形区域。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.27,
      "size": 52272,
      "text": "这个只有两条边的图形叫二角形，是球面几何独有的产物。屏幕上黄色那片月牙就是它。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "area",
      "line_id": "ar-1",
      "filename": "area-ar-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/area-ar-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.39,
      "size": 54288,
      "text": "二角形的面积公式简洁到出人意料。设两条边的夹角是阿尔法，那么面积恰好等于二倍阿尔法。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "area",
      "line_id": "ar-2",
      "filename": "area-ar-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/area-ar-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54000,
      "text": "推导只需一步比例。夹角转满二倍圆周率时，月牙就扫过整个球面，面积是四倍圆周率。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "area",
      "line_id": "ar-3",
      "filename": "area-ar-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/area-ar-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.38,
      "size": 70128,
      "text": "所以面积与四倍圆周率之比等于阿尔法与二倍圆周率之比，解出来就是二倍阿尔法。屏幕上数值积分独立验证了这个式子。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "check",
      "line_id": "ck-1",
      "filename": "check-ck-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/check-ck-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.28,
      "size": 52416,
      "text": "代几个数进去检验。夹角九十度时面积是圆周率，恰好是球面的四分之一，符合直觉。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "check",
      "line_id": "ck-2",
      "filename": "check-ck-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/check-ck-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.16,
      "size": 50544,
      "text": "夹角一百八十度时两条边合成一个完整大圆，月牙变成半球，面积二倍圆周率，也对。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "check",
      "line_id": "ck-3",
      "filename": "check-ck-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/check-ck-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.3,
      "size": 52848,
      "text": "请拖动夹角滑块，注意面积读数始终精确等于二倍夹角，占比始终等于夹角除以二倍圆周率。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "polygon",
      "line_id": "pg-1",
      "filename": "polygon-pg-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/polygon-pg-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.16,
      "size": 50544,
      "text": "切到多边形模式。球面上 n 边形的面积公式是：内角和减去 n 减二再乘圆周率。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "polygon",
      "line_id": "pg-2",
      "filename": "polygon-pg-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/polygon-pg-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.14,
      "size": 66240,
      "text": "注意平面上这个量恒等于零，因为平面 n 边形的内角和精确等于 n 减二乘圆周率。球面上多出来的部分就是面积。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "polygon",
      "line_id": "pg-3",
      "filename": "polygon-pg-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/polygon-pg-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.67,
      "size": 74736,
      "text": "屏幕上用两种独立算法核对：一是从形心切成三角形逐个求盈余，二是直接套内角和公式。两者残差在十的负十五次方量级。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "girard",
      "line_id": "gd-1",
      "filename": "girard-gd-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/girard-gd-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.57,
      "size": 57168,
      "text": "二角形最漂亮的用处是推出吉拉尔定理。三角形的三条边所在的三个大圆，把整个球面切成八块。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "girard",
      "line_id": "gd-2",
      "filename": "girard-gd-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/girard-gd-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.76,
      "size": 60192,
      "text": "用三对二角形去覆盖球面，每对的夹角就是三角形的一个内角。这些二角形的总面积是四倍内角和。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "girard",
      "line_id": "gd-3",
      "filename": "girard-gd-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/girard-gd-3.mp3",
      "duration": 5.3,
      "size": 84816,
      "text": "但覆盖过程中，三角形和它的对径三角形各被多数了两次。整理后得到面积等于内角和减圆周率，正是吉拉尔定理。屏幕上残差精确为零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.19,
      "size": 50976,
      "text": "第一，球面上两个大圆交于对径两点，夹出只有两条边的二角形，平面上没有这种图形。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.11,
      "size": 33696,
      "text": "第二，二角形面积等于二倍夹角，一步比例即可推出。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "spherical-lune",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/spherical-lune/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.42,
      "size": 70704,
      "text": "第三，n 边形面积等于内角和减去 n 减二乘圆周率，而三对二角形能推出吉拉尔定理。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
